WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Build a syllabus with intent. Reusable activities. An editable sequence. A teaching check.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:08.500
Start with a direction. Set the lesson count, learning priorities, and preferred activities.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:15.500
Assemble a draft. Rule-based selection reuses the activity library. The result stays editable.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:20.500
Make the sequence yours. Rename a lesson without changing the source activities.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:26.500
Check what teaching still needs. This sample draft is missing teaching materials. Arc makes the gap explicit before publication.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:32.000
Preview before release. Review the learning mix. Publishing and classroom assignment are separate.
